    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a start, but can you go deeper on the opposition? You said they \"vehemently oppose\" it, but isn't it mostly just people being afraid of change or trying to protect their own interests? Is there actually a logical argument against it, or is it mostly just political resistance?",
